==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Emilia & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Anti-Red Units, such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Dual Swordsman Cat]], and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Face Cat]] for an easy victory. Emilia & Doge has low stats, so she is not really a threat in this stage.

